<title>BELGIUM: EU to ship Danish, British wheat aid to Bangladesh.</title>
<headline>EU to ship Danish, British wheat aid to Bangladesh.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union will provide 25,000 tonnes of Danish wheat and 20,000 tonnes of British wheat as food aid to Bangladesh for shipment this month, a European Commission official said.</p>
<p>The official declined to give further information ahead of publication of the food aid tender result in the EU Official Journal, expected on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
